@startuml direct-rialto-handshake-nothing-to-give-sequence
title Handshake: needData arrives but there is nothing to send
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Rialto event thread" as EV
participant "AampRialtoMediaSource" as SRC
participant "NeedDataHandshake" as HS
participant "IMediaPipeline" as PIPE

EV -> SRC : handleNeedData(N, req=9)
SRC -> HS : OnNeedData(N, 9)
alt a previous request is still unanswered
  HS --> SRC : superseded = Claim(old req)
  SRC -> PIPE : haveData(NO_AVAILABLE_SAMPLES, old req)
end
alt gateMode is BLOCKED or DROPPED
  HS --> SRC : rejected = true (request NOT staged)
  SRC -> PIPE : haveData(NO_AVAILABLE_SAMPLES, 9)
  note right of PIPE
    Data sent against a request issued before SEEK_DONE
    would be discarded as stale by Rialto.  Answering at
    once makes Rialto ask again after the gate clears.
  end note
else gate NONE and EOS latched, no injector active
  HS --> SRC : eos = Claim(9)
  SRC -> PIPE : haveData(EOS, 9)
else gate NONE, no EOS (no sample available yet)
  HS --> SRC : request staged, hasPending = true
  note right of SRC
    No reply is sent.  Request 9 stays open until
    an injector fills it (normal sequence), EOS is
    signalled (SignalEos answers it), the gate/generation
    changes (Unblock answers it), or Rialto cancels it.
  end note
end
SRC -> HS : WakeWaiters()
note over SRC, HS
  WakeWaiters() runs after the replies above, so an injector
  cannot add segments before the NO_AVAILABLE_SAMPLES is sent.
end note
@enduml
